{
  "meta": {
    "is_partial": true,
    "description": "홈 우측 인기글 위젯 — g7-home-widgets 애드온 API(/api/plugins/g7-home-widgets/popular-posts, 코어 boards/popular 와 같은 정렬·필터 + category, 작성자 미포함) 연결, 10건, 기간 토글(이번주/이번달/1년, 오늘 제외). 좌측 _recent_posts_unified.json 과 같은 2줄 양식(게시판명 · 카테고리). 작성자는 표시하지 않는다"
  },
  "type": "basic",
  "name": "Div",
  "props": {
    "className": "bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 h-full flex flex-col"
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "basic",
      "name": "Div",
      "props": { "className": "flex items-center justify-between gap-2 flex-wrap mb-4" },
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "H3",
          "props": { "className": "text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2" },
          "children": [
            { "type": "basic", "name": "Icon", "props": { "name": "flame", "className": "w-5 h-5 text-orange-500" } },
            { "type": "basic", "name": "Span", "text": "$t:board.popular.title" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "comment": "기간 토글 — 같은 위젯 안에서 목록만 다시 불러온다(페이지 이동 없음). 기본값 주간. 오늘은 UTC 자정 기준이라 한국 오전 9시 전엔 비어 보여 제외",
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Div",
          "props": { "className": "flex items-center gap-1" },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Button",
              "props": {
                "className": "{{(_local.homePopularPeriod ?? 'week') === 'week' ? 'px-2.5 py-1 text-xs rounded-md font-medium bg-gray-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-gray-900 cursor-pointer' : 'px-2.5 py-1 text-xs rounded-md text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 cursor-pointer'}}"
              },
              "children": [{ "type": "basic", "name": "Span", "text": "$t:board.popular.this_week" }],
              "actions": [
                {
                  "type": "click",
                  "handler": "sequence",
                  "actions": [
                    { "handler": "setState", "params": { "target": "local", "homePopularPeriod": "week" } },
                    { "handler": "refetchDataSource", "params": { "dataSourceId": "home_popular_posts" } }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Button",
              "props": {
                "className": "{{(_local.homePopularPeriod ?? 'week') === 'month' ? 'px-2.5 py-1 text-xs rounded-md font-medium bg-gray-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-gray-900 cursor-pointer' : 'px-2.5 py-1 text-xs rounded-md text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 cursor-pointer'}}"
              },
              "children": [{ "type": "basic", "name": "Span", "text": "$t:board.popular.this_month" }],
              "actions": [
                {
                  "type": "click",
                  "handler": "sequence",
                  "actions": [
                    { "handler": "setState", "params": { "target": "local", "homePopularPeriod": "month" } },
                    { "handler": "refetchDataSource", "params": { "dataSourceId": "home_popular_posts" } }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Button",
              "props": {
                "className": "{{(_local.homePopularPeriod ?? 'week') === 'year' ? 'px-2.5 py-1 text-xs rounded-md font-medium bg-gray-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-gray-900 cursor-pointer' : 'px-2.5 py-1 text-xs rounded-md text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 cursor-pointer'}}"
              },
              "children": [{ "type": "basic", "name": "Span", "text": "$t:board.popular.year" }],
              "actions": [
                {
                  "type": "click",
                  "handler": "sequence",
                  "actions": [
                    { "handler": "setState", "params": { "target": "local", "homePopularPeriod": "year" } },
                    { "handler": "refetchDataSource", "params": { "dataSourceId": "home_popular_posts" } }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "basic",
      "name": "Div",
      "if": "{{home_popular_posts.data && home_popular_posts.data.length > 0}}",
      "props": { "className": "divide-y divide-gray-100 dark:divide-gray-700" },
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Div",
          "iteration": { "source": "{{home_popular_posts.data ?? []}}", "item_var": "post" },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Button",
              "props": { "className": "block w-full text-left py-3 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700/50 rounded-lg px-1 transition-colors cursor-pointer" },
              "actions": [{ "type": "click", "handler": "navigate", "params": { "path": "/board/{{post.board_slug}}/{{post.id}}" } }],
              "children": [
                {
                  "comment": "1줄: 제목 (인기글 API 는 비밀글을 제외하고 is_new 를 주지 않아 자물쇠/N 표시 없음)",
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "Div",
                  "props": { "className": "flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-0.5" },
                  "children": [
                    { "type": "basic", "name": "Span", "props": { "className": "text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white line-clamp-1" }, "text": "{{post.title}}" }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "comment": "2줄: 게시판명 · 카테고리 · 조회수 · 작성일 (좌측 최근글과 동일 양식)",
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "Div",
                  "props": { "className": "flex items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400" },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "basic",
                      "name": "Div",
                      "props": { "className": "flex items-center gap-1.5 min-w-0 flex-1" },
                      "children": [
                        { "type": "basic", "name": "Span", "props": { "className": "text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 shrink-0" }, "text": "{{post.board_name}}" },
                        { "type": "basic", "name": "Span", "if": "{{post.category}}", "props": { "className": "text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-600 shrink-0" }, "text": "·" },
                        { "type": "basic", "name": "Span", "if": "{{post.category}}", "props": { "className": "truncate min-w-0" }, "text": "{{post.category}}" }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "basic",
                      "name": "Div",
                      "props": { "className": "flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0" },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "basic",
                          "name": "Span",
                          "props": { "className": "inline-flex items-center gap-1" },
                          "children": [
                            { "type": "basic", "name": "Icon", "props": { "name": "eye", "className": "w-3 h-3" } },
                            { "type": "basic", "name": "Span", "text": "{{post.view_count ?? 0}}" }
                          ]
                        },
                        { "type": "basic", "name": "Span", "props": { "title": "{{post.created_at ?? ''}}" }, "text": "{{post.created_at_formatted ?? ''}}" }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "basic",
      "name": "Div",
      "if": "{{!home_popular_posts.data || home_popular_posts.data.length === 0}}",
      "props": { "className": "text-center py-8 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-center" },
      "children": [
        { "type": "basic", "name": "Icon", "props": { "name": "inbox", "className": "w-8 h-8 mx-auto mb-2 opacity-50" } },
        { "type": "basic", "name": "P", "props": { "className": "text-sm" }, "text": "$t:board.popular.no_posts" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
